  "title": "Control board floorplan B - DSP rotated 90 deg, PWM/fault/ADC-A side facing the mezzanine header",
  "status": "AI-GENERATED ENGINEERING PROTOTYPE - V2 - HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED",
  "description": "TMS320F28335 (U5) rotated 90 deg so that pins 1-44 (GPIO0-17 PWM/fault lines and ADCINA0-A7) face the 2 x 25 mezzanine header J8 along the bottom edge; the former bottom side (ADCINB, GPIO18-27, JTAG) faces the right-hand analogue section, XCLKIN faces the oscillator above the DSP and the boot/UART pins face the left strip with J4/J5. Supplies (eFuse, 5 V buck, dual LDO) in the top-left corner, 12V_PROT running down the left column to mezzanine pins 1-3, LDO 1V9 output in a corridor island feeding the DSP core island on In2.Cu, JTAG at the top-right edge, status LEDs and E-stop at the right edge, NTC at the lower right.",
